  /* Plan 05-09 Task 2 deviation: the post-Task-3 re-audit caught --terracotta bg
     (#82785d) + --paper fg (#f2ebdb) at 3.68:1 — under WCAG AA 4.5:1 for 13px bold
     text. Swap to --ink bg + --paper fg (>=15:1) — black-pill tag stays in the
